{"id":"ecf3419ef94e40ca","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-sld-answer-soundness.md","title":"计算答案的每个闭实例均在最小 Herbrand 模型中","display":"thm-sld-answer-soundness — 计算答案的每个闭实例均在最小 Herbrand 模型中","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-sld-answer-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-sld-answer-soundness"],"display":"thm-sld-answer-soundness — 计算答案的每个闭实例均在最小 Herbrand 模型中","depends_on":["[[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]]","[[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §5 opening paragraph, print661/PDF673; local definite-fragment soundness","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"逐个对照变量集 Var_S 及 Horn 最小模型 I_omega 的真实上游签名"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-sld-answer-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-sld-answer-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sld-answer-soundness — 计算答案的每个闭实例均在最小 Herbrand 模型中"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98e2eaadb15620c0\" href=\"?note=98e2eaadb15620c0\" title=\"72-df-sld-refutation-answer\">72-df-sld-refutation-answer</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f07e41c114d4b890\" href=\"?note=f07e41c114d4b890\" title=\"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model\">72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §5 opening paragraph, print661/PDF673; local definite-fragment soundness"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"逐个对照变量集 Var_S 及 Horn 最小模型 I_omega 的真实上游签名"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"98e2eaadb15620c0\" href=\"?note=98e2eaadb15620c0\" title=\"72-df-sld-refutation-answer\">72-df-sld-refutation-answer</a> 的确定程序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f07e41c114d4b890\" href=\"?note=f07e41c114d4b890\" title=\"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model\">72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model</a> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_\\omega\">\\(I_\\omega\\)</span> 的本地别名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 为正 goal，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\gamma:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为任意全闭项赋值，其对有限语法树的同时扩张沿用项递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SLDAns}_P(G,\\sigma)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\ \\forall i&lt;|G|\\ ((G_i\\sigma)\\gamma\\in I_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SLDAns}_P(G,\\sigma)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\ \\forall i&lt;|G|\\ ((G_i\\sigma)\\gamma\\in I_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿反驳逆向归纳。空 goal 无义务；每一步统一使选中原子与子句头的实例相同。对最终剩余变量任取闭项值，后续代入复合得到一个原子句的闭实例；逆向归纳使其体全在 I_P，而 I_P 对 T_P 闭合，故头也在 I_P。未选中的原子直接继承。最后限制答案到初始变量不改变初始 goal 的实例。这个论证适用于每个闭项延伸，不只某个选定见证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sld-refutation-answer","status":"resolved","id":"98e2eaadb15620c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model","status":"resolved","id":"f07e41c114d4b890","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sld-refutation-answer","status":"resolved","id":"98e2eaadb15620c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P$ 是 [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] 的确定程序；$I_P$ 是 [[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]] 中 $I_\\omega$ 的本地别名。$G$ 为正 goal，$\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$；$\\gamma:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma$ 为任意全闭项赋值，其对有限语法树的同时扩张沿用项递归。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model","status":"resolved","id":"f07e41c114d4b890","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P$ 是 [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] 的确定程序；$I_P$ 是 [[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]] 中 $I_\\omega$ 的本地别名。$G$ 为正 goal，$\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$；$\\gamma:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma$ 为任意全闭项赋值，其对有限语法树的同时扩张沿用项递归。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"I_P","display":false},{"tex":"I_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SLDAns}_P(G,\\sigma)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}\\ \\forall i<|G|\\ ((G_i\\sigma)\\gamma\\in I_P).","display":true}],"bytes":1977,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-557","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-552","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-uni